00:08:41.800 --> 00:08:47.060
Add APO to the TFSA watch list for any pullback below its 50-day moving average.

00:08:47.060 --> 00:08:52.520
And,thropic plans to begin marketing its initial public offering in mid-October with

00:08:52.520 --> 00:08:55.100
