00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:11.280
cloud software repairs before considering any allocation.

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:19.080
International Petroleum Corporation repurchased 36,111 common shares during the week of September

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:26.360
14 to 18 under its normal course issuer bid. The ongoing buyback reduces share count and supports

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:33.500
