00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:38.360
and consider adding on weakness if the repurchase program continues at the current pace.

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:43.760
Open your brokerage platform and pull up the 20-day average volume for any technology

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:45.720
name already in your TFSA.

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:50.800
Compare it to the most recent sessions volume and note whether the reading sits above or

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:51.740
below the average.

00:09:52.280 --> 00:09:56.780
Before we wrap, keep an eye on the volume reading for any technology names you already

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:58.060
